{"format":"kane-fabric-administrative-descriptor","format_version":1,"descriptor_id":"us.il.condominium.turnover","descriptor_version":1,"title":"Illinois Condominium — Developer Control & Turnover","help":"Statewide Illinois condominium transition from developer administration to the first owner-controlled board. Election triggers, turnover delivery duties, transition records, and developer-era contract cancellation boundaries are Infrastructure; actual dates, documents, contracts, receipts, and outcomes are association-instance data.","scope":{"country_code":"US","state_code":"IL","label":"Illinois statewide condominium infrastructure","applies_to":"condominium_developer_turnover","as_of_date":"2026-09-17","admission_rule":"Current-effective statewide Illinois condominium developer-control and turnover requirements are Infrastructure. Developer identity, conveyance progress, election dates, delivered materials, affected contracts, notices, votes, and litigation records are association-instance data."},"categories":[{"id":"turnover.developer_control","label":"Developer control"},{"id":"turnover.initial_election","label":"First unit-owner board election"},{"id":"turnover.delivery","label":"Developer turnover delivery"},{"id":"turnover.contracts","label":"Developer-era contract review"}],"authorities":[{"id":"il-condo-act-18-2","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/18.2","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K18.2","summary":"Administration before the first owner-controlled board; election timing, developer turnover delivery, contract cancellation, limitations tolling, and enforcement of delivery duties."}],"pages":[{"id":"developer-control-turnover","title":"Developer Control & Turnover","help":"The statewide framework defines transition milestones and required developer delivery. Association-instance fields record the actual transition evidence without assuming that every existing condominium is still in developer control.","sections":[{"id":"statewide-turnover-framework","title":"Statewide developer-control and turnover framework","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"developer-control-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Until election of the first board of managers comprised of a majority of unit owners other than the developer, the developer holds and performs the rights, powers, duties, and obligations otherwise vested in the board under the Act and condominium instruments.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"initial-election-trigger","kind":"notice","text":"The election of the first unit-owner board must be held not later than 60 days after the developer has conveyed 75% of the units, or 3 years after recording of the declaration, whichever occurs earlier.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"initial-election-notice","kind":"notice","text":"The developer must give at least 21 days notice of the meeting to elect the first unit-owner board.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"initial-voter-list-request","kind":"notice","text":"For the first board-election meeting, the developer must provide a requesting unit owner within 3 working days the names, addresses, and weighted vote of each unit owner entitled to vote; for subsequent board-election meetings the corresponding response period is 10 days.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"owner-petition-election","kind":"notice","text":"If the developer does not call the first-board election meeting within the statutory time, unit owners holding 20% of the association interest may petition the developer and then have authority to send notice and hold the meeting.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"developer-resignation-boundary","kind":"notice","text":"If the first unit-owner board is not elected at the established time, the developer continues in office for 30 days and then must send written notice of resignation to all unit owners entitled to vote at the election.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"turnover-delivery-deadline","kind":"notice","text":"Within 60 days following election of the first unit-owner board, the developer must deliver the Section 18.2(d) turnover materials to the board.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"turnover-demand-remedy","kind":"notice","text":"If the developer does not fully deliver the required turnover materials within 60 days and then fails to comply within 10 days after a written demand sent by registered or certified mail, the board may bring an action to compel compliance; Section 18.2(g) also addresses recovery of reasonable attorney fees and costs if required deliveries were not timely made.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"developer-contract-cancellation","kind":"notice","text":"Certain developer-era contracts, leases, or agreements extending more than 2 years from election of the first unit-owner board are subject to cancellation by a majority of votes of unit owners other than the developer cast at a special meeting during the 180-day period beginning on the election date. The board must notify every unit owner at least 60 days before that 180-day period expires, and an approved cancellation becomes effective 30 days after certified-mail notice to the other contracting parties.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":8}},{"id":"association-limitations-tolling","kind":"notice","text":"The statute of limitations for actions in law or equity that the condominium association may bring does not begin to run until unit owners have elected a majority of the board of managers.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":9,"span":4}}]},{"id":"turnover-milestones","title":"Developer-control transition milestones","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"developer-name","kind":"text","label":"Developer / declarant reference","binding":"association.turnover.developer_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"declaration-recorded-date","kind":"date","label":"Declaration recorded","binding":"association.turnover.declaration_recorded_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"total-units","kind":"number","label":"Total units","binding":"association.turnover.total_units","min":1,"step":1,"unit":"units","format":"integer","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"developer-conveyed-units","kind":"number","label":"Units conveyed by developer","binding":"association.turnover.developer_conveyed_units","min":0,"step":1,"unit":"units","format":"integer","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"seventy-five-percent-date","kind":"date","label":"75% conveyance reached","binding":"association.turnover.seventy_five_percent_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"election-notice-date","kind":"date","label":"First-board election notice","binding":"association.turnover.election_notice_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"first-owner-board-election-date","kind":"date","label":"First owner-board election","binding":"association.turnover.first_owner_board_election_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"owner-petition-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"20% owner-petition reference, if used","binding":"association.turnover.owner_petition_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"developer-resignation-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Developer resignation notice reference","binding":"association.turnover.developer_resignation_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"turnover-demand-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Turnover demand / compliance reference","binding":"association.turnover.demand_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":9,"span":4}}]},{"id":"turnover-package","title":"Developer turnover package","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"turnover-package-items","kind":"collection","label":"Section 18.2(d) turnover inventory","binding":"association.turnover.package_items","min_items":0,"item_label":"Turnover item","actions":{"add_label":"Add turnover item","remove_label":"Remove turnover item"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"turnover-package-category","kind":"select","label":"Statutory category","binding":"category","options":[{"value":"recorded_and_association_documents","label":"Recorded and association documents"},{"value":"accounting_insurance_loans","label":"Accounting, insurance, and outstanding loans/advances"},{"value":"segregated_association_funds","label":"Segregated association funds"},{"value":"association_property_warranties_tax","label":"Association property, equipment, warranties, deeds/title, and tax bills"},{"value":"litigation_government_drawings_disputes","label":"Litigation, government notices/certificates, drawings/specifications, enforcement and dispute records"}],"required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"turnover-package-description","kind":"textarea","label":"Item / contents","binding":"description","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"turnover-package-status","kind":"select","label":"Delivery status","binding":"status","options":[{"value":"delivered_original","label":"Original delivered"},{"value":"delivered_certified_copy","label":"Certified copy delivered"},{"value":"partial","label":"Partial"},{"value":"missing","label":"Missing"},{"value":"not_applicable","label":"Not applicable"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"turnover-package-delivered-date","kind":"date","label":"Delivered","binding":"delivered_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"turnover-package-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Document / transfer reference","binding":"reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":5}},{"id":"turnover-package-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Notes / deficiency reference","binding":"notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":9,"span":4}}]},{"id":"turnover-package-deadline","kind":"date","label":"60-day turnover deadline","binding":"association.turnover.package_deadline","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"turnover-package-complete-date","kind":"date","label":"Turnover package complete","binding":"association.turnover.package_complete_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"turnover-package-completeness-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Completeness / deficiency record","binding":"association.turnover.package_completeness_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":9,"span":4}}]},{"id":"developer-era-contract-review","title":"Developer-era contract review","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-2"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"contract-cancellation-window-end","kind":"date","label":"180-day cancellation window ends","binding":"association.turnover.contract_cancellation_window_end","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"contract-owner-notice-deadline","kind":"date","label":"Owner notice deadline","binding":"association.turnover.contract_owner_notice_deadline","help":"Section 18.2(e) requires notice at least 60 days before expiration of the 180-day cancellation period.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"contract-owner-notice-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Owner notice reference","binding":"association.turnover.contract_owner_notice_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"developer-era-contracts","kind":"collection","label":"Developer-era contracts subject to review","binding":"association.turnover.developer_era_contracts","min_items":0,"item_label":"Agreement","actions":{"add_label":"Add turnover agreement","remove_label":"Remove agreement"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"turnover-contract-reference","kind":"text","label":"Contract / lease reference","binding":"reference","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"turnover-contract-party","kind":"text","label":"Other party","binding":"other_party","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"turnover-contract-end-date","kind":"date","label":"Contract end date","binding":"end_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":2}},{"id":"turnover-contract-over-two-years","kind":"select","label":"Extends >2 years from election?","binding":"extends_over_two_years","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"turnover-contract-special-meeting-date","kind":"date","label":"Special meeting","binding":"special_meeting_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"turnover-contract-vote-result","kind":"select","label":"Observed vote result","binding":"vote_result","options":[{"value":"cancelled","label":"Majority voted to cancel"},{"value":"retained","label":"Not cancelled"},{"value":"no_vote","label":"No vote observed"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"turnover-contract-cancellation-notice-date","kind":"date","label":"Certified-mail cancellation notice","binding":"cancellation_notice_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"turnover-contract-effective-date","kind":"date","label":"Cancellation effective","binding":"cancellation_effective_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"turnover-contract-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Meeting / notice / contract notes","binding":"notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":12}}]}]}]}]}